Package: btrbak
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-yaml (>= 6), python3-googleapi, python3-google-auth-oauthlib, btrfs-progs
Recommends: age
Maintainer: Kaiden <11036039+KaidenP@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: btrfs snapshot and offsite backup utility
 btrbak creates read-only btrfs snapshots, ships incremental offsite
 backups with btrfs send, verifies remote objects against a local
 manifest, and prunes expired snapshots.
 .
 Configuration lives in /etc/btrbak/profiles.d; see btrbak-profiles(5)
 for the file format.
